    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d748">

                <pb facs="0611" n="495" xml:id="pg495"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/23425.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Mediators to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-05-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 2, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With the acceptance of our good offices by
                    all the parties interested in the pacific and amicable settlement of the
                    conflict between the United States and Mexico, the time has arrived formally to
                    begin negotiations.</p>
                <p>For this purpose it is necessary that each of the parties name its
                    representatives before the Mediators for the purpose of discussing the bases of
                    settlement.</p>
                <p>After representatives have been appointed, we shall hasten to fix the date for
                    the inauguration of the conference.</p>
                <p>We renew [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">D. da Gama</hi>.</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. S. Naón</hi>.</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ed’o Suarez Mujica</hi>.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
